       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. HELL-LOOP.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-TRANSACTION-COUNT PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
       01 WS-GHOST-STATE       PIC X(10) VALUE "RESTLESS".
       01 WS-BALANCE           PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 66666.66.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM UNTIL WS-TRANSACTION-COUNT > 9999
               ADD 1 TO WS-TRANSACTION-COUNT
               IF WS-TRANSACTION-COUNT = 666
                   MOVE "POSSESSED" TO WS-GHOST-STATE
                   DISPLAY "PRAYER OVERFLOW: THE MACHINE BREATHES"
               END-IF
           END-PERFORM.
           STOP RUN.
